1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:05,550
Every customer leaves a trail of data.
Most of it goes unread.

2
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:10,870
Their payments show it: a growing family,
a new car, a renovation, a new home.

3
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:17,380
Seekridge reads your CRM and transaction
data, alongside live market data.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,320
This customer's family is growing.

5
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:25,560
It's your moment to offer a mortgage
for a bigger home, right on time.

6
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:31,100
This one is about to buy a car. Offer your
car loan before the dealer does.

7
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,970
Another is renovating.
Time to offer a green loan.

8
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:43,250
And this one just bought a home, with no
cover. Time for a home insurance offer.

9
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:48,590
Every Monday, the week's moments
arrive ranked, in your CRM.

10
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:54,390
Seekridge. Opportunities
you can act on, and explain.

